{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_1.png?t=1753812332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc8c\u00a0<i>OFFICIAL LETTER FROM CUBIVERSITY ADMISSIONS!\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udc8c</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dear Student, Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are thrilled to inform you that you have been accepted into Cubiversity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet 15 charming classmates, and join the prestigious Crafting Club, a cozy place to sew together something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/b18a843568ca101985750cf015f1a98c.poster.avif?t=1753812332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/b18a843568ca101985750cf015f1a98c.webm?t=1753812332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/b18a843568ca101985750cf015f1a98c.mp4?t=1753812332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_2.png?t=1753812332\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Romance by elimination</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick 5 students for your project group, and end up with your soulmate at the end of the week!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modular dialogue based on the group you pick, the locations you go to, and many other variables, makes sure no two runs  are ever the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices that matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each choice you make leads to a different ending. But no 3 a.m. breakdowns over a single wrong dialogue option, we promise!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inclusive and heartfelt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love comes in many forms, and Love Craft makes room for all of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_3.png?t=1753812332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We look forward to having you join us next week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yours sincerely, <br>Jean, President of the Crafting Club \ud83d\udc8b</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691640?t=1753812332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/40fdf26efe6a6b13f43093bab4d4ddd546b52f63/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753812332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/6e7780cced036b27ccc6dafc9324bf0f50aa5d89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753812332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/6e7780cced036b27ccc6dafc9324bf0f50aa5d89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753812332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_1.png?t=1753812332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc8c\u00a0<i>OFFICIAL L