rtfelt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love comes in many forms, and Love Craft makes room for all of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_3.png?t=1753812332\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We look forward to having you join us next week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yours sincerely, <br>Jean, President of the Crafting Club \ud83d\udc8b</p>","developers":["Toiu"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/697d75a995588fcc35003ccecc33794e6c4fb572/header.jpg?t=1753812332","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152259,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152259/movie480.mp4?t=1749215036","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152259/movie_max.mp4?t=1749215036"},"name":"LoveCraft Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152259/1e22c2634e525523d61909510001a301e26169d2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749215036","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152259/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749215036","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152259/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749215036"}}],"name":"Love Craft","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 Ghz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Toiu"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors